🎯 What I Learned
Multi-Agent Orchestration: Coordinating multiple LLM agents with distinct roles and state transitions.

Prompt Engineering: Designing highly structured JSON-based prompts to ensure reliable outputs.

Rate Limiting: Handling API rate limits and retries with exponential backoff.

Full-Stack Integration: Connecting a React frontend with an asynchronous FastAPI backend and SQLite.

🔮 Future Improvements
□ Implement WebSockets for real-time cycle updates instead of polling.
□ Add a "Peer Review" feature where AI students evaluate each other.
□ Build a Knowledge Graph to track long-term student learning paths.
□ Deploy to production using Docker and AWS.
