🚀 Getting Started (Local Setup)
Prerequisites
Python 3.10+

Node.js 18+

Google Gemini API Key (Get it here free)

1. Backend Setup
bash
cd backend
python -m venv venv

# Windows
venv\Scripts\activate
# Mac/Linux
source venv/bin/activate

pip install -r requirements.txt

# Create .env file and add your API key
echo "GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here" > .env

# Run the server
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
Backend will run on http://localhost:8000

2. Frontend Setup
bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
Frontend will run on http://localhost:5173

🎮 How to Use
Open the frontend in your browser (http://localhost:5173).

Go to the Dashboard to see the initial seeded professors and students.

Click the big glowing "Run Cycle" button on the top right.

Watch the Live Activity Timeline as AI professors assign work, students submit it, and grades are generated.

Navigate to the Research Papers and Curriculum tabs to see the autonomous output.

