Is README ko upload karne ke baad, jab bhi tumhara project complete ho jaye, Screenshots wale section me apne project ki 2-3 achhi photos daal dena. Interviewer pehle README padhta hai aur agar usme screenshots aur badges dikhte hain, toh bahut professional lagta hai! 🚀

Agar aage koi code likhna shuru karo aur koi error aaye, toh batana!

giginore
Bhai, tumne "giginore" likha hai, mujhe lag raha hai tum .gitignore file maang rahe ho. (Ye wahi file hai jo humne pichle message me discuss ki thi, taaki tumhari API keys aur node_modules GitHub pe upload na ho).

Ye file bahut zaroori hai. Tum apne project ke root folder (sabse bahar, jahan backend aur frontend folder hain) me ek nayi file banao jiska naam exactly .gitignore ho (shuru me dot . zaroor lagana).

Isme ye code copy-paste kar do:

